{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1284811-so-i-want-to-create-an-a-i-cult","id":1284811,"title":"So I want to create an A.I. cult.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-02-04T15:01:00-08:00","id":1284811,"title":"So I want to create an A.I. cult.","content":"I'm playing a Virtual Adept. I want a cult, but I didn't want to take the Cult merit at character creation, so I'll be going about it in-game. I want to develop an A.I. puppet to be the figurehead of a cult. I want to use the cultists as a support group of hackers, and as an eventual source of quintessence.<br /> <br /> My spheres are Correspondence and Matter at 3 dots, with Entropy, Forces, Mind, Prime, and Spirit at 2 dots, inept in Time sphere.<br /> <br /> How should I go about this? How should I present the A.I.? How should I recruit followers? What are some useful rotes or ideas you have for this kind of thing? What are some of the weird ideas or wacky extremes that can be extrapolated?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24747-timballisto","name":"Timballisto","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-04T16:27:46-08:00","id":1284833,"title":"","content":"First thing that leaps to mind: Look at Anonymous, that could be a very good concept basis for this kind of thing.<br /> Or: Some kind of Virtual Pop Idol (I think there are a few Anime and similar things like this)<br /> Or: Again with an Anime influence but you could get a little bit Sword Art Online with it<br /> Or: Take a Matrix approach with how Neo is looking for Morpheus at the begining<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-05T00:05:15-08:00","id":1284897,"title":"","content":"...I mean just find all those people who are deathly afraid of Roko Basalisk...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-02-05T11:29:08-08:00","id":1285017,"title":"","content":"Draws one could see to worshipping an AI:<br /> *Held up as a mascot, a kind of anti-Data from Star Trek where adherents wish to shed human flaws. It'd have an almost Akashic angle to it.<br /> *Held up as a paragon, AI has attributes the adherents wish to learn from in the form of the AI not being subject to human bias and the worhsippers feeling its wisdom is somehow truer than what humans come up with.<br /> *Held up as a future god (the Roko's Basilisk option). Adherents would see the entity gain power and feel they'd be spared when it takes over.<br /> *Claim it's a seed from The Machine and that it'll eventually rule Autocthonia<br /> <br /> Invest in having the AI be able to do something useful like find sectors in the digital web, find soft spots in the Umbra, find information of some type (maybe using the Data sphere instead of correspondence) or something.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15603-phillycuriosity","name":"PhillyCuriosity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}